# Midterm Project Topic Selection

## Overview
This assignment focused on selecting a machine learning topic for the midterm project.

## Topic
Using machine learning to detect malicious network traffic.

## Problem Area
Cybersecurity and intrusion detection.

## What I Planned to Build
The goal was to classify network traffic as either benign or malicious using supervised machine learning models.

## Reflection
This topic was selected because cybersecurity is a real-world area where machine learning can help detect threats faster than manual methods.
